  "$id": "https://pitchlog.local/contracts/state-transition/terminal_pitch_schema_v1.json",
  "title": "無走者BB/HBPのT1数学ABI候補 v1",
  "$comment": "未受理候補。JSON型/局所範囲と要求応答相関は別。T2/実ID/保存/資格を証明しない。",
  "oneOf": [
    {
